apns.h1_f:
POST https://api.push.apple.com/3/device/<device_token>
Goiburuak: apns-topic: <bundle_id>, apns-push-type: alerta, apns-collapse-id: room:42
Gorputza: {aps: {alerta: {titulua, gorputza}}, datuak: <zigilatua>}

bmp.h1_f:
mailbox_id = HKDF(recipient_pubkey, info="bmp-v1", len=32)
Gordailua: POST /bmp/deposit {mailbox_id, blob ≤1MB}
Bilketa: GET /bmp/messages (baimendutakoa)

